| grouped_int4_sum_avg_candidate | 1M | custom_scan_dispatch | 0 | 30 | correctness_diffs/grouped_int4_sum_avg_candidate-1000000.json | reported | - | 10 | 10 | 10000000 | 10000000 | 0 |

